{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y把几处细微的情绪转折压成了概述，尤其S07少了X中“刚有点安心，却猛然想到”的情绪反差和身体感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的大字更容易迅速抓住每段核心，小字又补足了几个重要的心理区分：想念不等于决定回头，承认曾经开心也不等于否认受过的委屈。这让人物的矛盾、选择及其变化更容易理解，前后也形成了更清楚的主题连贯性。X的优势是情绪展开更有呼吸感，细微的心理起伏和感官体验更自然；Y偶尔把这些压成结论，损失了一些细腻度，但整体观看体验仍然是Y更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6c99a741-b9ef-450d-adfa-02d1be68d6c7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195129561339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:52:19.889498+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c34175eab42c87a1dde794423e5057d15e7ad747fd2416f57d0aef1441ff031c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee